# Unittest (agents)

Do **not** run `python -m unittest discover … | grep` twice to learn pass/fail and failure names.

Use one command from repo root:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=. HARCHOC_ALLOW_BASE_PYTHON=1 python scripts/run_tests.py
```

- **`-q`** — minimal progress; still prints summary + `PROBLEMS` block.
- **`-v`** — include full tracebacks under each problem.

Implementation: [`harchoc/unittest_report.py`](../../harchoc/unittest_report.py), entrypoint [`scripts/run_tests.py`](../../scripts/run_tests.py).
